cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If referencing this software demonstration, cite the repository and release version. Reported port data retain their separate source attribution."
type: software
title: "PortLab Desktop: Offline Port Forecasting, Simulation and 3D Replay"
authors:
  - family-names: "Rezwan"
    given-names: "Mojib"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-04
repository-code: "https://github.com/Rezwanm381/portlab-desktop"
url: "https://github.com/Rezwanm381/portlab-desktop"
abstract: >-
  A Python desktop scenario laboratory for Guam and Conley port planning,
  with exploratory annual forecasting, finite-resource discrete-event
  simulation, conditional operating comparisons and recorded 3D replay.
  Synthetic operational examples do not validate real port performance.
keywords:
  - discrete-event simulation
  - port operations
  - forecasting
  - Python
  - PySide6
  - Panda3D
